The Flutter web bundle lands here. Built automatically by the
Ino.Kernel build target (when `flutter` is on PATH).

Manual build, if needed:

    cd clients/ino.flutter
    flutter build web --no-tree-shake-icons
    cp -r build/web/* ../../src/Ino.Kernel/wwwroot/

After `aspire run`, the gateway serves these files at the kernel silo's
HTTPS endpoint. The SPA fallback routes unknown paths to index.html;
GoRouter's path-url strategy handles deep links.
